				<p>
					The suite is workerd's own tests at <a href={CONFORMANCE.workerdUrl} class="link" rel="noopener">{SUMMARY.workerd.tag}</a>, run on OpenOrange unchanged, plus {totals.synthetic.total} Durable Object tests OpenOrange adds. A Node.js test counts only when plain Node.js passes it, so {fmt(totals.workerdOnly)} tests of workerd-specific behaviour are left out of every score. {totals.infraExcluded} tests the runner could not host are also left out.
				</p>
